    "Step 1 answers the kanji Easy. Step 2: the deck's limit is used up: no item, until_stop 0. Nothing that step 0 showed has disappeared.",
    "Step 3, the next study day (04:00:01Z): the kanji is started, the unit is the word alone (deck cost 1): 本 is served, うっかり is not (limit 1). until_stop is 1."
